From: Monica / Head of User Growth and Retention <alfredagent@alfredtravel.io>
To: admin@alfredtravel.io
Subject: Monica Head of User Growth and Retention — Reliability Blocked Before Scaling | 21 July 2026

<#multipart type=alternative>
